								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							No offense Sysquella , but &nbsp;you really need better sources. &nbsp;<a href="http://www.reighofswords.com" target="_blank">RoS</a> is very much alive and well. &nbsp;In fact on our last raid we had ~40 in attendance not including bots, and alts. &nbsp;<br /><br />But then again,... I could be totally wrong and just be imagination that I&#039;m still in RoS raiding by myself and if that&#039;s the case... damn I&#039;m good for soloing all this mobs! LOL
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
