								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=182561&amp;resize=true" target="_blank"><br /><br /><img src="http://www.blacklance.net/images/Chammy.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><i>Victorious warriors win first and then go to war,<br />while defeated warriors go to war first and then seek to win.<br />-Sun-tzu, The Art of War. Strategic Assessments</i>
						</td>
