							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							With the current state of Vn boards, i have come here for new drama.<br /><br />1-Ascent<br />2-Eie/DA<br />3-Fot<br />4-Arirang<br />5-Forsaken<br />6-Hegemony<br />7-Spirit of Verzi<br />8-Uop<br /><br />Sov has more pop progression, tier 1 shit is still harder than vt and ssra=P. &nbsp;Forsaken likes to blow fr rings, and Hegemony is gonna be ele flagged soon.
