							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Gosh, you know as an ex-RoS member I feel compelled to throw in my 2 cp. &nbsp; I'd love to see my old guild right up there but I must &nbsp;agree with my colleauge Fig on the rankings. &nbsp;I will submit to you the additon of RoS and Convic though.<br /><br />1-Ascent<br />2-Eie/DA<br />3-FoT &nbsp;<br />4-Arirang<br />5-Forsaken<br />6-Hegemony<br />7-RoS/Convic<br />8-Spirit of Verzi<br />9-Uop<br /><br /><br /><br />I still have friends in both RoS and Convic so really can't make an objective call which should be ranked higher atm, &nbsp;so gonna call them tied for now &nbsp; &nbsp;=) although I am looking forward to see which guild will mack RZTW first &nbsp;.... These are both fine guilds and I forsee each becoming ele flagged (as a guild) by years end.<br /><br />edit: spelling<br />
