							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Love how many guilds move ahead of UoP from the above posters considering they havent even done mobs like Cursed, Emp, VT, AHR, etc, hehe. &nbsp;UoP has been fully VT flagged for months now and already had some easy take downs in PoP on off content nights. &nbsp;RoS and Conviction are both half guilds now, SoV who, and Hege, LOL, they can only do things with other guilds helping them, that has already been proven time and again.<br /><br />Anyhow . . .<br /><br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
