									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg2578#msg2578">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #71 on:</b> October 27, 2003, 05:35:22 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> Cursed, emp, vt, ahr, that shit is all jokes compared to stuff in pop, unless Uop can do stuff like Saryrn, MM, Carprin, Bertox, or Rydda Dar, there gonna be ranked lower cuz that luclin stuff is total jokes that can all be 30 manned </div><br />Gee, I guess that proves my point since I have friends in both guilds (RoS/Hege) who have been in raids that wiped to Emp / Cursed with more than 30.<br /><br />If your going to say something, try and spit that foot out first &nbsp; :-X<br /><br />
