	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg2596"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=243" title="View the profile of Chammy">Chammy</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 39<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.blacklance.net/images/hottie2.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Officer of Reign of Swords<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=243"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.reignofswords.com" title="Reign of Swords" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Chammy@reignofswords.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg2596#msg2596"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg2596#msg2596">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #72 on:</b> October 28, 2003, 01:27:53 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I am not sure whom your friends in RoS are, but I can assure you we have not wiped to Cursed ever. &nbsp;In fact, we have only fought Cursed Cycle once in which we had 27 people in the raid and killed him with around four or so deaths. &nbsp;We have not had the opportunity to try Emp, in fact the few times we even considered trying him, we did not have enough people keyed online. Since we have not tried him, I do not see how you can claim that we have wiped to him.<br /><br />If your going to say something, try and spit that foot out first &nbsp; :-X<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
