								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=251"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg2603#msg2603"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg2603#msg2603">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #74 on:</b> October 28, 2003, 05:30:36 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Quote from Mendolok<br />&quot; RoS and Conviction are both half guilds now, SoV who, and Hege, LOL, they can only do things with other guilds helping them, that has already been proven time and again.&quot;<br /><br />..please remind me, what guild have helped us in any encounter of which of those has been mentioned?<br /><br />The only one I can remember was a joint event with Avatar of Might which was more an agreement, they got AoW if we got Statue in Kael. Main reason was we were first in Kael but were only like 23 raiders and 2 clerics. Instead of just steam rolling us, an agrement was made. And that was like 6-8 months ago.<br /><br />As for Hegemony getting help in PoP. I was unaware of it until you mentioned it. Although Im not online during Us timeline, so I could have missed something.<br /><br />And ya, Chammy is pwn. She easily got the pretties Avatar on this board ;)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
